<section class="zone"><div class="blk-row"><div class="blk blk-embed"><div class="embed"><iframe src="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1RPHFtP1Ki0yeJLIcEV5CNEWVxp-C8i-VwhYnPaW2Zdg/htmlembed" title="CW | Recrutement Shock" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen=""></iframe><a class="embed-open" href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1RPHFtP1Ki0yeJLIcEV5CNEWVxp-C8i-VwhYnPaW2Zdg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ Ouvrir CW | Recrutement Shock</a></div></div></div><div class="blk-row"><div class="blk blk-embed"><div class="embed"><iframe src="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1s35lNIWEgRRo3ccA1e8QtXu3bhGYgvb2yOlmdMXwSdg/preview" title="CW | Guide Shock Recrutement" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen=""></iframe><a class="embed-open" href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1s35lNIWEgRRo3ccA1e8QtXu3bhGYgvb2yOlmdMXwSdg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ Ouvrir CW | Guide Shock Recrutement</a></div></div></div></section>
